-- =========================================================
-- V8_1: Mock academic data (dev profile only)
-- =========================================================
-- Runs after schema/V8 (which re-creates all FK constraints on
-- empty tables). Deterministic UUIDs, prefixed per entity type
-- for readability, matching the convention already used here:
--   a0... day_of_week   b0... faculty       c0... school
--   d0... classroom     e0... subject       f0... academic_period
--   10... teacher       11... groups        12... class_hour
--   13... class (enrollment)                14... schedule
-- =========================================================

-- 1. Days of week (7 days, lowercase)

-- 2. Faculty

-- 3. Schools (two, to exercise multi-school listings)

-- 4. Classrooms

-- 5. Subjects (spread across both schools)

-- 6. Academic periods (one active, one past/inactive for filtering tests)

-- 7. Teachers (linked to Nicole + the 5 teacher users from dev-data/V7)

-- 8. Groups (spread across teachers/subjects/classrooms/periods)

-- 9. Class hours (one per group)

-- 10. Class_hour_day (join table for ManyToMany)

-- 11. Class (student enrollments — links an ESTUDIANTE user to a group)

-- 12. Schedule (at most one row per user, per the UNIQUE(user_id) constraint —
--     pins one of each student's enrollments as their active schedule entry)
